  "description": "OptunaSharp's bridge to the live Python Optuna ecosystem via Python.NET (pythonnet), most importantly OptunaHub (https://hub.optuna.org/). OptunaHub.LoadModule(\"samplers/auto_sampler\") / (\"benchmarks/bbob\") mirrors optunahub.load_module, and the loaded contributor packages are wrapped so an OptunaSharp Study can drive them directly: a hub SimpleBaseSampler becomes an OptunaSharp BaseSampler (over a synchronized shadow study), and a hub BaseProblem becomes an OptunaSharp objective (search space + directions + evaluate). The .NET analog of NumSharp.Interop.pythonnet. Requires a discoverable CPython with `pip install optuna optunahub`. Part of the SciSharp STACK.",
